        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Living near Horamavu Main Road, Kalkere, or Jayanthi Nagar means you don't need to negotiate heavy Outer Ring Road traffic for world-class dental care. House of Dental is located directly on Horamavu Agara Road, providing quick, convenient access for everyday cleanings and emergency dental treatments.
