              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Emergency Dentist Horamavu</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth leading-relaxed font-light">
            Acute tooth pain cannot wait. We reserve priority emergency slots daily for Horamavu residents with severe toothaches, chipped crowns, or sudden swelling, providing immediate pain relief on the same day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-cream border border-japandi-clay/60 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/60 flex items-center justify-center text-japandi-moss">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 21 11.25v7.5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Sunday Dental Care (9:30 AM – 9 PM)</h3>
