        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">From urgent toothache relief to advanced cosmetic smile transformations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/30 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-3 hover:border-japandi-moss transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
            <a href="/treatments/root-canal-treatment" class="hover:text-japandi-moss">Single-Sitting Root Canal (RCT)</a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
