          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
            Discreet teeth straightening with 3D digital smile simulation and flexible monthly EMI payment options.
          </p>
          <a href="/treatments/clear-aligners" class="inline-flex text-xs font-medium text-japandi-moss hover:underline">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/30 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-3 hover:border-japandi-moss transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
            <a href="/treatments/emergency-dentist" class="hover:text-japandi-moss">Emergency Dental Care</a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
            Same-day emergency appointments for knocked-out teeth, excruciating nerve pain, and sudden swelling.
