            <a href="/treatments/scaling-and-polishing" class="hover:text-japandi-moss">Teeth Cleaning &amp; Scaling</a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
            Gentle ultrasonic plaque removal and enamel polishing to eliminate bad breath and prevent gum disease.
          </p>
